    "body": "There is a small trick that you can use to check old toolkit documentations \ud83d\ude00 [https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit-archive](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit-archive)\r\n`CUSPARSE_SPMM_CSR_ALG3` and SpMV algorithms have been introduced in CUDA 11.2u1 [https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/11.2.1/cusparse/index.html#cusparse-generic-function-spmm](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/11.2.1/cusparse/index.html#cusparse-generic-function-spmm)",
